This project is a modified version of Chat 2 (ChatTwo).

Original work: Anna (ascclemens) and Infi (Infiziert90)
Upstream: https://github.com/Infiziert90/ChatTwo
Licence: European Union Public Licence, version 1.2 (EUPL-1.2). The full text is in LICENCE.

Modification date: 2026-11-15
Modification: Chat Sharp (C#). The assembly and internal name stay ChatTwoVanilla so existing installs keep their settings and updates. The chat log is drawn with the game's own UI textures, Axis font, channel colours, and log transparency. Commands, ImGui window ids, and IPC channels stay distinct from Chat 2 so both plugins can load together. /chatsharp is the command; /chat2vanilla remains an alias.

The original source was imported with its git history. Commits after that import are the fork.
